# Optional: `pnpm start` runs the web app with none of this (and sets CORE_URL itself, from
# core's PORT). Copy to .env.local for `pnpm dev`, or to change a default.
# Where core listens. Only this server reaches it: the browser calls /core on this site, which
# proxy.ts passes on here, so the owner's session cookie stays this site's own. Read as the web
# app starts. Unset, core on this machine (http://127.0.0.1:4000).
# CORE_URL=
